  "prefLabel": "Env-A 2902.11 Alternative monitoring system",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2902.11 “Alternative monitoring system” means a system, or a component of a system, that is designed to provide direct or indirect data of mass emissions per time period, pollutant concentration, or volumetric flow, as provided for in this chapter.\n\nSource. #10002, eff 10-1-11 (from Env-A 2903.11); ss by #12995, eff 2-25-20",
